<programme start="20261102020000 +0000" stop="20261102050000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Virginia at Wake Forest</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 14 Wake Forest Demon Deacons and the Virginia Cavaliers meet at Allegacy Federal Credit Union Stadium for an ACC matchup. Quarterback Beau Pribula leads Virginia with 13 TDs, while quarterback Gio Lopez leads Wake Forest with 17 TDs.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261102050000 +0000" stop="20261102080000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">California at NC State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The California Golden Bears visit the NC State Wolfpack. Both teams arrive with a two-game skid. The California Golden Bears fell 59-20 to the No. 23 SMU Mustangs, and the NC State Wolfpack suffered a 31-28 loss to the Stanford Cardinal last week.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261102080000 +0000" stop="20261102110000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at Louisville</sub-title><desc lang="en">Louisville Cardinals host Stanford Cardinal at L&amp;N Stadium. Louisville relies on Lincoln Kienholz after three total touchdowns in a 34-26 win, while Stanford counts on Davis Warren and four passing scores following a 31-28 victory over NC State.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
