<programme start="20261102170000 +0000" stop="20261102190000 +0000" channel="NHL Network"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Edmonton Oilers at New York Rangers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The New York Rangers host the Edmonton Oilers in NHL regular-season play at Madison Square Garden. At 7-6 and having lost four of their last five, the Rangers face an Oilers side that has won four of the last five meetings between these clubs.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
